	(text_box "The INA219 measures the voltage drop across\nthe 25 mOhm shunt resistor (R69) to monitor\nload current. At 2A, VSHUNT = 50mV.\nCurrent measurements are reported via I2C.\nThe INA219 does not directly trip the breaker."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.138 94.6017 0)
		(size 50.8 12.1268)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
